<#78b4ff>IMAGINE BREAKER</>
Imagine Breaker		^X
  Negates projectiles at his right hand. Tapped at
  the right moment it also stops a hit.
Imagine Breaker (hold)		^X (hold)
  Keeps the stance up. Drains meter while held and
  drops when meter runs out.
Break Your Illusion Real Quick		_D_DF_F^X
  Right after Imagine Breaker catches something.
  Free after a projectile negate, otherwise 1 bar.

<#78b4ff>LUCK CHANGE</>
Luck Change		_D_D^X
  Spends the full luck gauge (the bar under his luck
  name) to go up one stage. Each stage needs more:
  <#555555>Bad Luck</> > <#aaaaaa>Unlucky</> > Hard Luck > <#0000ff>Hard Luck Blue</>
Luck gauge
  Fills when Imagine Breaker negates a projectile and
  when the Triple Swipe chain hits.
  Also fills slowly by itself in neutral, quicker at
  each stage, then very slowly for the last climb.
<#0000ff>HLB Extra</>		_D_D^X (in <#0000ff>HLB</>)
  Full gauge + 3 bars. Turns meter into free supers
  for a while. At low HP it becomes <#ffff00>Good Luck</>.
<#ff0000>Calamity</>		^X_+^Y (in Hard Luck)
  Full gauge. Hits harder and recharges meter by
  itself, but he cannot block.
New round
  If he ended the round in <#0000ff>HLB</>, HLB Extra, <#ffff00>Good Luck</>
  or <#ff0000>Calamity</>, he starts the next one at <#aaaaaa>Unlucky</>.
  The higher the stage, the harder his supers hit.

<#78b4ff>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves
  him open.
Roman Cancel		^Z (attack hit or blocked)
  1 bar in <#0000ff>HLB</>, 2 bars otherwise.
Grab		^Y
Air Grab		^Y (air)
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second
  cooldown.
Evasion		^A_+^B
Meter Charge (hold)		^A_+^C
Dash		_F_F
Air Dash		_F_F (air)
Back Hop		_B_B

<#78b4ff>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Crouching Light / Medium / Heavy		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
Football Kick		_F^A
Tackle to Uppercut		^B^B
Jawbreaker		_F^C
Elbow to Facepunch		_D^B^B
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Down You Go!		_D^C (air)
  Floor bounce, twice per combo.

<#78b4ff>SPECIALS</>
Triple Swipe		_D_DF_F^A
  Follow up with ^A^A, ^B^B or ^C^C. Fills the luck gauge.
Triple Punch		_D_DF_F^B
  Follow up with ^B^B.
Rising Breaker Low / Mid		_F_D_DF^A / ^B
Buster Impact Short / Mid		_D_DB_B^A / ^B
Tooo / Geternak		_D_DB_B^A / ^B (air)
Hand Slap		_D_DF_F^X
Break Yo Face (command grab)		_F_D_DF^X

<#78b4ff>EX SPECIALS (1 bar)</>
True Rising Breaker (<#aaaaaa>Unlucky</>+)		_F_D_DF^C
Flurry Rush (<#aaaaaa>Unlucky</>+)		_D_DF_F^C
Todomedaaaa (<#aaaaaa>Unlucky</>+)		_D_DB_B^C (air)
True Buster Impact (Hard Luck+)		_D_DB_B^C

<#78b4ff>SUPERS</>
Hand of Crowley (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
First Comes Rock (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
  Any two of A / B / C.
Sono Gensou wo Buchikorosu (3 bars, Hard Luck+)
		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
<#0000ff>Weakest Punch Counter</> (3 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
